				911b3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				165.16
			</span></i>; part of Sagittarius, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				25
			</span></i>.</div>
